  m_Name: item_l26_gene_birthday
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlorifiedBody.Interaction.ItemDefinition
  itemId: l26_gene_birthday
  displayName: A PRINTED EMAIL
  kind: 1
  drugType: 0
  colour: {r: 0.96, g: 0.95, b: 0.88, a: 1}
  description: a printed email.
  logText: 'FROM: Rosa, RN, Ward 2

    TO: All Staff, Floors 1 and 2

    DATE:
    Tuesday, December 22, 6:14 PM

    SUBJECT: RE: RE: GENE''S BIRTHDAY!!!!! DEC
    25!!!!!

    Not this year, Gene.


    FROM: Gene, Orderly

    TO: Rosa, RN,
    Ward 2; All Staff, Floors 1 and 2

    DATE: Tuesday, December 22, 6:09 PM

    SUBJECT:
    RE: GENE''S BIRTHDAY!!!!! DEC 25!!!!!

    My birthday is in July.


    FROM:
    Rosa, RN, Ward 2

    TO: All Staff, Floors 1 and 2

    DATE: Tuesday, December
    22, 5:51 PM

    SUBJECT: GENE''S BIRTHDAY!!!!! DEC 25!!!!!

    Everybody!!!
    Per the Staff Handbook, Section 9: "Birthdays may be celebrated in staff areas."
    So. Gene''s birthday is December 25 this year!!! Cafeteria, 8 PM, between shifts.
    Bring a dish. Denise is doing the lights, there''s a little tree (a BIRTHDAY
    tree), and the kitchen may or may not have a bird for us, I did not say that.
    All decorations are birthday decorations. Wear something festive. For Gene.

    RosaFROM:
    GENE. My birthday is in July.


    FROM: ROSA. Not this year, Gene.'
  readFlag: 
  mapFloor: 
  audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  tapeLines: []
